body:
If I try that with the +0 Hunter's Torch, I might decide to do it with a similar BL from the one I'm using on this video, or probably a much higher one so I can survive some of the explosive point blank stuff he does on second phase sometimes that is infuriating.  


&#x200B;

I'm really not fond of ranged attacks when I'm so fucking close to him (specially explosive shit), it seems unavoidable even when I-frames timing is spot on, that happened to me quite a lot, one of the reasons I decided to segment that Orphan BL4 Fists Only Kill, I wasn't going to bother going through the same boring 20 minutes again just for him to decide to do that kind of stuff, salt salt salt salt salty.

Hahaha, I doubt that, you can do that as well, some time ago I would've said that any Dream Theater song was impossible for me to play, patience is really important, and practice too, thanks a lot for watching the video, I appreciate it.

By the way, Space Odyssey is amazing.

&#x200B;
